---
description: Testing — keep and extend regression tests
globs: "**/{tests,test,spec}/**/*.{py,ts,tsx,js,go}"
alwaysApply: false
---

Do not delete, skip, or weaken tests to make a suite pass. When fixing a bug, add or keep a regression that would have failed before the fix. Prefer the project's test runner over inventing a new one. Pair test changes with `agentic-sdlc doctor` / the repo's native test command, not a prompt that claims tests passed.
